:expect-pins 5
# Retained full-source amendment-semantics scenarios for AS-06.
# Candidate source deltas are explicit counterfactual edits, never enacted by a label.

# The original unregistered target label remains.
? adjust(Amend_Mint, Art_Mint).
# => TRUE

# The added registered target label is present.
? adjust(Amend_Mint, Art_Floor).
# => TRUE

# An added target label supplies no personal credibility finding.
? false(Amend_Mint).
# => FALSE

# Neither set of target labels supplies enactment status.
? become(Amend_Mint, Law).
# => FALSE

# No floor source effect accompanies the target-label change.
? entitled(Adam, event { eats() }).
# => TRUE
